  "body": "This prime 1,078 sq m development site in central Takapuna offers an exceptional opportunity for immediate development. Zoned for Terraced Housing and Apartment Building (THAB), all the necessary permits, including Resource Consent (RC), Building Consent (BC) and Engineering Plan Approval (EPA), have already been secured. With the vendor having done all the hard work, this property presents a unique ready-made development opportunity.\r\n\r\nSituated in one of Auckland's most sought-after suburbs, the flat, north-facing site boasts breathtaking city and sea views. It is just minutes away from Takapuna Beach, as well as the area's bustling shops, restaurants and cafes. Central Takapuna is currently undergoing significant growth, driven by both private and council investment, further enhancing its desirability. With easy access to the motorway, the site also offers seamless connectivity to the CBD.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this rare opportunity- contact me today for further details.\r\n\r\nBoundary lines shown in the pictures are indicative only.",
